  "details": "It would be appreciated if the mobile particle shaders had the ability to toggle backface culling. By default it is forced off, which is less performant. Some situations would not require backface to be off, in which case some creators would enjoy having the ability to enable backface culling. There are more uses than this, as well. There are some creative contexts where backface culling may be needed to achieve a certain effect.",
